  "name": "FerroBRIDGERdeO11ToBundle",
  "title": "FerroBRIDGE supplement: RDE_O11 to Bundle",
  "status": "active",
  "experimental": true,
  "publisher": "Cadasto B.V. (FerroBRIDGE)",
  "description": "Adds a message map for the HL7 v2 RDE_O11 structure (O11, pharmacy/treatment encoded order; http://hl7.org/v2/StructureDefinition/RDE_O11), for which hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0 ships none. The rows are those of ConceptMap/message-orm-o01-to-bundle for the segments RDE_O11 shares with ORM_O01, at their RDE_O11 paths: the patient segments under PATIENT (the visit under PATIENT_VISIT), the order under ORDER, and the RXO row into MedicationRequest for the RXO of ORDER.ORDER_DETAIL; the RXR rows of the vaccination map are not taken, since the guide maps RXR into Immunization there. The guide ships no segment map for RXE, RXC, RXV, CDO, FT1, BLG or CTI, so those stay counted as unmapped. FerroBRIDGE #637.",
